# Literature Corpus Search Query
# 基于 ARS v3.6.4 corpus-first, search-fills-gap 协议

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  citekey AS "Citekey",
  title AS "Title",
  authors AS "Authors",
  year AS "Year",
  venue AS "Venue",
  contamination_signals.preprint_post_llm_inflection AS "Preprint?",
  contamination_signals.semantic_scholar_unmatched AS "S2 Unmatch?",
  pre_screened_status AS "Status"
FROM "4_AI情报洞察/论文洞察/_corpus"
SORT year DESC, citekey ASC
```

## PRE-SCREENED 统计

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  pre_screened_status AS "Status",
  length(rows) AS "Count"
FROM "4_AI情报洞察/论文洞察/_corpus"
GROUP BY pre_screened_status
```

## 污染信号过滤

```dataview
TABLE citekey, title, year, contamination_signals
FROM "4_AI情报洞察/论文洞察/_corpus"
WHERE contamination_signals.preprint_post_llm_inflection = true
   OR contamination_signals.semantic_scholar_unmatched = true
   OR contamination_signals.openalex_unmatched = true
   OR contamination_signals.crossref_unmatched = true
SORT citekey ASC
```

## 项目文献关联

```dataview
TABLE citekey, title, year, project, pre_screened_status
FROM "4_AI情报洞察/论文洞察/_corpus"
WHERE project = "your-project-name"
SORT year DESC
```